Pemozone
========

An iOS and iPadOS Minecraft: Java Edition client with a focus on touch controls.

This product is an independent community project. It is NOT an official release
of Pomme, and it is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or produced by the Horizon
project, Mojang Studios or Microsoft.


